{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive the charm of retro gaming \u2013 with all its clunky frustrations!</strong><br>Awesome Mix Tape is a growing collection of bite-sized, single-mechanic games packed into one nostalgic experience. Think of it as your personal mixtape \u2013 but instead of music, it\u2019s a playlist of fun, quirky, colourful micro-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>What\u2019s Inside?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of fast, simple, and addictive games \u2013 perfect for quick sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges that range from fun and casual to experimental prototypes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing free updates with brand-new micro-games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc <strong>Why \u201cMix Tape\u201d?</strong><br>Inspired by the days of cassettes and classic gaming, Awesome Mix Tape brings back that feeling of discovery. Each game is a surprise \u2013 something new to try every time you launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Install once, keep it forever \u2013 and watch your collection grow!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clunk Click","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1437160/9104fa318c71fa3574f96d93e4d94dcd652e989f.jpg"},{"name":"B-O-N-U-S","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1437160/e48c54258a97c2360b49d650810ee2b39e3ae5df.jpg"},{"name":"Living on the Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1437160/adfc2057c1e12efed9bf2247f7320f00fd50daf8.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1437160/437d54a2b9b993740b462a6d942d5c94973d44b4.jpg"},{"name":"Where's me Jumper?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1437160/4fc3b5830315071ea3a85acb2bd757